  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 6212 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E5"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Our baclofen supply comes from Bryant Ranch Prepack, which FDA inspected on 2009-06-11 and classified OAI on 2009-09-09.",
      "cites": ["E15", "E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That OAI classification occurred 6212 days before the 2026-10-21 posting date.",
      "cites": ["E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA subsequently issued a Warning Letter on 2010-04-08 for the same facility.",
      "cites": ["E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "All later inspections from 2010 through 2026-07-16 were classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E6", "E7", "E8", "E9", "E10", "E11", "E12", "E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 34 days on hand, Corvale General has 24 days, and Corvale Lakeside has 28 days.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The best option by rule is to buy from A-S Medication Solutions, which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": []
    }
  ]
}
